00:22:40.092 --> 00:22:43.562
Cut down this raspberry patch for the first time

00:22:44.463 --> 00:22:45.897
for a year, it was nothing.

00:22:45.897 --> 00:22:48.900
But now there was a small forest growing,

00:22:49.067 --> 00:22:51.770
too much for us to eat.

00:22:51.770 --> 00:22:54.773
And, they're very invasive.

00:22:55.107 --> 00:22:57.209
And these are the shoots of...

00:22:57.209 --> 00:22:59.811
like the brown ones are from last year.

00:22:59.811 --> 00:23:03.148
They'll give fruit early in the season.

00:23:03.148 --> 00:23:04.683
So late spring.

00:23:04.683 --> 00:23:06.518
Then there will be new shoots as well.

00:23:06.518 --> 00:23:09.187
They'll give fruits end of summer,
basically.

00:23:09.187 --> 00:23:12.190
Like in September or so.

00:23:12.891 --> 00:23:14.626
So that's still enough for us to eat.

00:23:14.626 --> 00:23:17.429
The birds don't eat them very much.

00:23:17.429 --> 00:23:19.464
But we like them, so

00:23:19.464 --> 00:23:21.166
But it was getting too big

00:23:21.867 --> 00:23:23.568
so this is overseeable

